@Afro = Afro.API
@Afro.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000
@ContentType = application/json

# Auth API Tests

# SearchOwner API Tests

### Search Owner - Get all owners
GET {{Afro.API_HostAddress}}/api/searchowner
Content-Type: {{ContentType}}

### Search Owner - Get owner by ID
GET {{Afro.API_HostAddress}}/api/searchowner/1
Content-Type: {{ContentType}}

### Search Owner - Search by name
GET {{Afro.API_HostAddress}}/api/searchowner?name=john
Content-Type: {{ContentType}}

### Search Owner - Search with pagination
GET {{Afro.API_HostAddress}}/api/searchowner?page=1&pageSize=10
Content-Type: {{ContentType}}

### Search Owner - Create new owner
POST {{Afro.API_HostAddress}}/api/searchowner
Content-Type: {{ContentType}}

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "phone": "1234567890"
}

### Search Owner - Update owner
PUT {{Afro.API_HostAddress}}/api/searchowner/1
Content-Type: {{ContentType}}

{
  "name": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "phone": "0987654321"
}

### Search Owner - Delete owner
DELETE {{Afro.API_HostAddress}}/api/searchowner/1
Content-Type: {{ContentType}}


